y9jhR4CgUzE1OzOROHJ2-xDIAjdBCP8cg",{"latestBlog":102},[103,106,109,112,115],{"title":104,"slug":105},"港式英语，勉强算英语吧","hongkong-english-accent",{"title":107,"slug":108},"显微镜下的大明之丝绢案","under-the-microscope",{"title":110,"slug":111},"用chatGPT学俄语","chatgpt-teaches-russian",{"title":113,"slug":114},"夏洛克·福尔摩斯和H·H·福尔摩斯：其实没什么关系","sherlock-holmes-and-h-h-holmes",{"title":116,"slug":117},"手疼的时候想到八佰伴","oshin-and-yaohan",{"id":119,"title":120,"body":121,"categories":721,"description":722,"extension":723,"meta":724,"navigation":96,"path":729,"seo":730,"slug":731,"stem":732,"tags":733,"__hash__":737},"blog\u002Fblog\u002F2021-02-07-nuxt-blog-generate-files-n-push-to-another-repo.md","使用Github Actions把Nuxt静态网站push到其他repository",{"type":122,"value":123,"toc":714},"minimark",[124,129,138,145,156,159,176,179,182,189,206,214,217,220,235,600,628,631,634,638,641,656,667,673,682,686,689,694,697,710],[125,126,128],"h2",{"id":127},"发现github-actions","发现GitHub Actions",[130,131,132,133,137],"p",{},"之前研究过 ",[134,135,136],"code",{},"Travis CI"," 之类的持续集成服务，但是我自己的小工程实在用不上，而且我写的东西怕是也不配套。",[130,139,140,141,144],{},"后来看到了 GitHub 的 ",[134,142,143],{},"Actions"," 服务，貌似可以写个自动化流程，然后只要 push 到 repo 就能触发更新。",[130,146,147,148,155],{},"这里有个 ",[149,150,154],"a",{"href":151,"rel":152},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ruanyifeng.com\u002Fblog\u002F2019\u002F09\u002Fgetting-started-with-github-actions.html",[153],"nofollow","教学"," 。",[130,157,158],{},"我兴冲冲地研究了下，想给我的 Nuxt 博客弄个自动部署更新啥的，但是有两个问题",[160,161,162,166],"ol",{},[163,164,165],"li",{},"我的博客用了本机自建的 api，自动部署时无法自动开启",[163,167,168,169,172,173,175],{},"很多教程都是要发布到 ",[134,170,171],{},"gh-pages"," 里面，而我的 Nuxt 博客工程文件在一个私有的 Repo 里，不公开就不能用 ",[134,174,171],{}," 这个分支。",[130,177,178],{},"如果找不到办法把生成的静态文件 push 到博客网站所在的 repo ，那我就不能做这个自动部署了。",[125,180,181],{"id":181},"发现推送到其他repo的方法",[130,183,184,185,188],{},"我最近给 Nuxt 升了级，还用了 Nuxt 的新模块 ",[134,186,187],{},"content"," 来解析博客内容，这个比我自己写的 api 好用多了。",[130,190,191,192,195,196,199,200,205],{},"在停用本机自建 api 之后，我想起之前看过的将 Nuxt 生成的静态文件目录 ",[134,193,194],{},"dist\u002F"," 部署到 ",[134,197,198],{},"Github pages"," 的 ",[149,201,204],{"href":202,"rel":203},"https:\u002F\u002Fnuxtjs.org\u002Fdocs\u002F2.x\u002Fdeployment\u002Fgithub-pages",[153],"教程","，我现在满足使用这个方法的前提了，再找找有没有办法把静态文件推送到其他 repo 的办法，也许我就能实现自动部署了呢！",[130,207,208,209,213],{},"然后我果然很幸运地找到了这个 ",[149,210,204],{"href":211,"rel":212},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarketplace\u002Factions\u002Fpush-directory-to-another-repository",[153],"，这就是我要实现的效果。",[130,215,216],{},"好了，是时候展示我制造缝合怪的功力了！",[125,218,219],{"id":219},"详细步骤和代码",[130,221,222,223,226,227,230,231,234],{},"在要使用的项目分支下新建 ",[134,224,225],{},".github"," 文件夹，里面再新建 ",[134,228,229],{},"workflows"," 文件夹，然后在里面新建 ",[134,232,233],{},"cd.yml","，输入以下代码：",[236,237,241],"pre",{"className":238,"code":239,"language":45,"meta":240,"style":240},"language-yml shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","name: cd\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  cd:\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        os: [ubuntu-latest]\n        node: [14]\n\n# checkout@ 这里写你的分支名称\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout\n        uses: actions\u002Fcheckout@master\n\n      - name: Setup node env\n        uses: actions\u002Fsetup-node@v2.1.2\n        with:\n          node-version: ${{ matrix.node }}\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm install\n\n      - name: Generate\n        run: npm run generate\n\n      - name: Publish\n        uses: cpina\u002Fgithub-action-push-to-another-repository@v1.3\n        env:\n          API_TOKEN_GITHUB: ${{ secrets.API_TOKEN_GITHUB }}\n        with:\n          source-directory: 'dist'\n          destination-github-username: 'username'\n          destination-repository-name: 'username.github.io'\n          user-email: email@email.com\n","",[134,242,243,259,264,285,289,298,305,315,320,328,335,348,361,366,372,380,393,404,409,421,431,439,450,455,466,477,482,494,504,509,520,530,538,549,556,567,578,589],{"__ignoreMap":240},[244,245,247,251,255],"span",{"class":246,"line":16},"line",[244,248,250],{"class":249},"s9eBZ","name",[244,252,254],{"class":253},"sVt8B",": ",[244,256,258],{"class":257},"sZZnC","cd\n",[244,260,261],{"class":246,"line":34},[244,262,263],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":96},"\n",[244,265,266,270,273,276,279,282],{"class":246,"line":19},[244,267,269],{"class":268},"sj4cs","on",[244,271,272],{"class":253},": [",[244,274,275],{"class":257},"push",[244,277,278],{"class":253},", ",[244,280,281],{"class":257},"pull_request",[244,283,284],{"class":253},"]\n",[244,286,287],{"class":246,"line":7},[244,288,263],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":96},[244,290,292,295],{"class":246,"line":291},5,[244,293,294],{"class":249},"jobs",[244,296,297],{"class":253},":\n",[244,299,300,303],{"class":246,"line":24},[244,301,302],{"class":249},"  cd",[244,304,297],{"class":253},[244,306,307,310,312],{"class":246,"line":39},[244,308,309],{"class":249},"    runs-on",[244,311,254],{"class":253},[244,313,314],{"class":257},"${{ matrix.os }}\n",[244,316,318],{"class":246,"line":317},8,[244,319,263],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":96},[244,321,323,326],{"class":246,"line":322},9,[244,324,325],{"class":249},"    strategy",[244,327,297],{"class":253},[244,329,330,333],{"class":246,"line":95},[244,331,332],{"class":249},"      matrix",[244,334,297],{"class":253},[244,336,338,341,343,346],{"class":246,"line":337},11,[244,339,340],{"class":249},"        os",[244,342,272],{"class":253},[244,344,345],{"class":257},"ubuntu-latest",[244,347,284],{"class":253},[244,349,351,354,356,359],{"class":246,"line":350},12,[244,352,353],{"class":249},"        node",[244,355,272],{"class":253},[244,357,358],{"class":268},"14",[244,360,284],{"class":253},[244,362,364],{"class":246,"line":363},13,[244,365,263],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":96},[244,367,368],{"class":246,"line":27},[244,369,371],{"class":370},"sJ8bj","# checkout@ 这里写你的分支名称\n",[244,373,375,378],{"class":246,"line":374},15,[244,376,377],{"class":249},"    steps",[244,379,297],{"class":253},[244,381,383,386,388,390],{"class":246,"line":382},16,[244,384,385],{"class":253},"      - ",[244,387,250],{"class":249},[244,389,254],{"class":253},[244,391,392],{"class":257},"Checkout\n",[244,394,396,399,401],{"class":246,"line":395},17,[244,397,398],{"class":249},"        uses",[244,400,254],{"class":253},[244,402,403],{"class":257},"actions\u002Fcheckout@master\n",[244,405,407],{"class":246,"line":406},18,[244,408,263],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":96},[244,410,412,414,416,418],{"class":246,"line":411},19,[244,413,385],{"class":253},[244,415,250],{"class":249},[244,417,254],{"class":253},[244,419,420],{"class":257},"Setup node env\n",[244,422,424,426,428],{"class":246,"line":423},20,[244,425,398],{"class":249},[244,427,254],{"class":253},[244,429,430],{"class":257},"actions\u002Fsetup-node@v2.1.2\n",[244,432,434,437],{"class":246,"line":433},21,[244,435,436],{"class":249},"        with",[244,438,297],{"class":253},[244,440,442,445,447],{"class":246,"line":441},22,[244,443,444],{"class":249},"          node-version",[244,446,254],{"class":253},[244,448,449],{"class":257},"${{ matrix.node }}\n",[244,451,453],{"class":246,"line":452},23,[244,454,263],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":96},[244,456,457,459,461,463],{"class":246,"line":10},[244,458,385],{"class":253},[244,460,250],{"class":249},[244,462,254],{"class":253},[244,464,465],{"class":257},"Install dependencies\n",[244,467,469,472,474],{"class":246,"line":468},25,[244,470,471],{"class":249},"        run",[244,473,254],{"class":253},[244,475,476],{"class":257},"npm install\n",[244,478,480],{"class":246,"line":479},26,[244,481,263],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":96},[244,483,485,487,489,491],{"class":246,"line":484},27,[244,486,385],{"class":253},[244,488,250],{"class":249},[244,490,254],{"class":253},[244,492,493],{"class":257},"Generate\n",[244,495,497,499,501],{"class":246,"line":496},28,[244,498,471],{"class":249},[244,500,254],{"class":253},[244,502,503],{"class":257},"npm run generate\n",[244,505,507],{"class":246,"line":506},29,[244,508,263],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":96},[244,510,511,513,515,517],{"class":246,"line":13},[244,512,385],{"class":253},[244,514,250],{"class":249},[244,516,254],{"class":253},[244,518,519],{"class":257},"Publish\n",[244,521,523,525,527],{"class":246,"line":522},31,[244,524,398],{"class":249},[244,526,254],{"class":253},[244,528,529],{"class":257},"cpina\u002Fgithub-action-push-to-another-repository@v1.3\n",[244,531,533,536],{"class":246,"line":532},32,[244,534,535],{"class":249},"        env",[244,537,297],{"class":253},[244,539,541,544,546],{"class":246,"line":540},33,[244,542,543],{"class":249},"          API_TOKEN_GITHUB",[244,545,254],{"class":253},[244,547,548],{"class":257},"${{ secrets.API_TOKEN_GITHUB }}\n",[244,550,552,554],{"class":246,"line":551},34,[244,553,436],{"class":249},[244,555,297],{"class":253},[244,557,559,562,564],{"class":246,"line":558},35,[244,560,561],{"class":249},"          source-directory",[244,563,254],{"class":253},[244,565,566],{"class":257},"'dist'\n",[244,568,570,573,575],{"class":246,"line":569},36,[244,571,572],{"class":249},"          destination-github-username",[244,574,254],{"class":253},[244,576,577],{"class":257},"'username'\n",[244,579,581,584,586],{"class":246,"line":580},37,[244,582,583],{"class":249},"          destination-repository-name",[244,585,254],{"class":253},[244,587,588],{"class":257},"'username.github.io'\n",[244,590,592,595,597],{"class":246,"line":591},38,[244,593,594],{"class":249},"          user-email",[244,596,254],{"class":253},[244,598,599],{"class":257},"email@email.com\n",[130,601,602,603,606,607,612,613,616,617,620,621,624,625,627],{},"代码中使用的 ",[134,604,605],{},"API_TOKEN_GITHUB"," 可以到 ",[149,608,611],{"href":609,"rel":610},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fsettings\u002Ftokens",[153],"这个页面"," 来生成，生成好之后切换到用来生成文件的项目的 repo 那里，在 ",[134,614,615],{},"Settings"," 里面的 ",[134,618,619],{},"Secrets"," 里面添加刚才生成的 ",[134,622,623],{},"token"," ，如果你取的名字不是 ",[134,626,605],{}," ，那么在前面的代码里记得把相关引用改成自己取的名字。",[130,629,630],{},"然后把项目工程文件和新创建的工作流程 push 到 GitHub 上，就能触发自动部署更新了。",[130,632,633],{},"完~",[125,635,637],{"id":636},"_2021-04-28更新","2021-04-28更新",[130,639,640],{},"原来的Action路径",[236,642,644],{"className":238,"code":643,"language":45,"meta":240,"style":240},"uses: cpina\u002Fgithub-action-push-to-another-repository@master\n",[134,645,646],{"__ignoreMap":240},[244,647,648,651,653],{"class":246,"line":16},[244,649,650],{"class":249},"uses",[244,652,254],{"class":253},[244,654,655],{"class":257},"cpina\u002Fgithub-action-push-to-another-repository@master\n",[130,657,658,659,662,663,666],{},"Action 的作者把自己的 repo 分支名从 ",[134,660,661],{},"master"," 改成 ",[134,664,665],{},"main"," 了，所以如果有人 push 了之后发现网站没更新，而 GitHub 的 Action 执行结果报错，显示内容如下",[668,669,670],"blockquote",{},[130,671,672],{},"fatal: Remote branch master not found in upstream origin",[130,674,675,676,678,679,681],{},"这个意思是说找不到 ",[134,677,661],{}," 这个分支，那么你改成 ",[134,680,665],{}," 就可以了。",[125,683,685],{"id":684},"_2021-10-31更新","2021-10-31更新",[130,687,688],{},"Action 的作者又更新了，现在会报错",[668,690,691],{},[130,692,693],{},"fatal: Remote branch main not found in upstream origin",[130,695,696],{},"最新版要改成这样",[236,698,700],{"className":238,"code":699,"language":45,"meta":240,"style":240},"uses: cpina\u002Fgithub-action-push-to-another-repository@v1.3\n",[134,701,702],{"__ignoreMap":240},[244,703,704,706,708],{"class":246,"line":16},[244,705,650],{"class":249},[244,707,254],{"class":253},[244,709,529],{"class":257},[711,712,713],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s9eBZ, html code.shiki .s9eBZ{--shiki-default:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D}html pre.shiki code .sVt8B, html code.shiki .sVt8B{--shiki-default:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8}html pre.shiki code .sZZnC, html code.shiki .sZZnC{--shiki-default:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF}html pre.shiki code .sj4cs, html code.shiki .sj4cs{--shiki-default:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF}html pre.shiki code .sJ8bj, html code.shiki .sJ8bj{--shiki-default:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);backgro